		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x7: needs C >= 2uF, V rated >= 100V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 14110, 0.2490 USD each at 7. C 2.2uF meets min 2uF; V rated 100V meets min 100V (122 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Motor-1 bus ceramics, 100 V X7R 1210 2.2 uF (request: 3 per half-bridge, 9 per motor; this group is C3-C9 and C10-C11 follow below). 100 V is 2.3x the 43.2 V pack. TDK CGA6 series, Active at JLC with 14,110 in stock (JLC catalogue basis only, passive). DC-bias derating at 40 V is large for X7R 1210 (assume roughly half of 2.2 uF); to be checked against the Murata/TDK bias curve before qualifying. Prior art: memirmakar/foc-driver HANDOVER.md uses 2.2 uF 100 V X7R 1210 per leg."
