				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.Note" "Symbol Wright:STL90N10F7 is kept only for its 5-pin shape (S x3 merged on pins 1-3, G 4, D 5 = pins 5-8 and tab); the pinout matches Vishay doc 63091 Rev C: S 1,2,3; G 4; D 5,6,7,8. Footprint is the KiCad library Package_SO:PowerPAK_SO-8_Single (kicad-footprints Package_SO.pretty/PowerPAK_SO-8_Single.kicad_mod, drawn from Vishay doc 71655 outline and doc 72599 recommended minimum pads); the ST-derived Wright:PowerFLAT-8_5x6mm_ST-typeR is no longer used by this part. Land pattern taken from the maintained library, not fabrication-qualified by Wright."
			(at 259.08 33.02 0)
