		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Chip resistor x6: needs R = 10Ω. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 297396, 0.0042 USD each at 6. R 10Ω meets = 10Ω (353 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Motor-1 gate turn-off resistors, 10 ohm 1% 0603, in series with the turn-off diode so turn-off stays faster than the DRV8300U 200 ns fixed dead-time (prior art memirmakar/foc-driver HANDOVER.md: turn-off 10 ohm + diode, FET off time must stay under the driver dead-time). Provisional, tuned at bring-up. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
