		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-07 MOSFET x12: needs Vds >= 100V, Id >= 60A. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 2915, 0.9671 USD each at 12. Vds 100V meets min 100V; Id 100A meets min 60A. Design-in: no open design in the corpus uses it. Freshness: catalogue freshness 0.00 (C7363870 is in the newest 54% of 19,525 listings in MOSFETs + Silicon Carbide Field Effect Transistor (MOSFET)). (6 other candidates passed; 6 other candidates on the shortlist) Chosen because: Motor 2 FET, same part as motor 1 Q1-Q6 so the two power stages stay identical. Chosen from the SO-8 / 5x6 shortlist: 100 V, 60 A-class, 5.1 mOhm at 7.5 V, 2915 in stock, Vishay PowerPAK SO-8, passing gate. Alternatives on the 5x6 shortlist (FDMS86101DC 7.5 mOhm, BSC0805LS 7 mOhm) are higher Rds(on) with no design-in either. No open design in the corpus uses it: watch carried on purpose. Gate: lifecycle Unknown: jlcparts listing lists it, which is a catalogue listing, not a manufacturer status; no manufacturer lifecycle source is configured (no Digi-Key or Mouser key in parts.json), so the gate cannot prove Active; introduction date unknown (no datasheet first date, research report or curated row), so the age rule could not run"
