		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x9: needs C >= 2uF, V rated >= 100V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 14110, 0.2490 USD each at 9. C 2.2uF meets min 2uF; V rated 100V meets min 100V (121 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Motor-2 bus ceramics, 100 V X7R 1210 2.2 uF, 3 per half-bridge x 3 = 9, same part as motor 1 C3-C11. 100 V is 2.3x the 43.2 V pack. JLC catalogue basis only (passive), 14,110 in stock. DC-bias derating at 40 V is large for X7R 1210 (assume about half of 2.2 uF); check the bias curve before qualifying."
