		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x2: needs C >= 2uF, V rated >= 100V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 14110, 0.2490 USD each at 2. C 2.2uF meets min 2uF; V rated 100V meets min 100V (132 other candidates passed) Chosen because: LM5164 input ceramics, 2 x 2.2 uF 100 V X7R 1210 per the TI reference design (table 7-1 lists the TDK CGA6N3X7R2A225K, this is the same series and value as the bus ceramics). 100 V against 43.2 V pack and 77 V TVS clamp; DC-bias derating large, input also sits behind the 3000 uF bulk caps. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
