		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Chip resistor x6: needs R = 1kΩ. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 6117952, 0.0026 USD each at 6. R 1kΩ meets = 1kΩ (474 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Output RC filter resistor, 1 k 5% 0603 per channel between each INA240 OUT and the MCU ADC pin; with 1 nF that is a 159 kHz corner, under the amplifier's 400 kHz and above the PWM-rate current content. Starting value matches the 1 k series output resistor seen in sf-motion Inverter.kicad_sch; to be tuned against ADC sampling. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
