		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Chip resistor x2: needs R = 75kΩ. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 570002, 0.0022 USD each at 2. R 75kΩ meets = 75kΩ (218 other candidates passed) Chosen because: VBUS divider top leg, 2 x 75 k 1% 0603 in series (150 k): each resistor sees half of the bus, so a 77 V TVS clamp transient is 38 V per resistor, under the 75 V 0603 rating. With 10 k bottom the ratio is 16, so 43.2 V reads 2.7 V and 46 V reads 2.88 V, inside a 3.3 V ADC range. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
