					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-05 Buck / DC-DC converter IC x1: needs Vin >= 20V, Iout >= 600mA. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 6970, 1.2671 USD each at 1. Vin 32V meets min 20V; Iout 2A meets min 600mA. Design-in: used by 13 open designs, last designed in 2026 (FujiNetWIFI/fujinet-hardware, Andresse2020/NovaDrone-Hardware, hstarmans/firestarter ...); matched exact. Freshness: catalogue freshness 0.00 (C780769 is in the newest 31% of 4,683 listings in DC-DC Converters). (1960 other candidates passed; 7 other candidates on the shortlist) Chosen because: 3.3 V buck from +12V, replaces TPS54202DDCR. TI names TPS542021 as successor but no enabled catalogue lists it, so it cannot pass the gate here. Chosen because it tops the shortlist with 13 open designs last used 2026 (FujiNet, NovaDrone power boards) and 6,970 in stock, against LMR51610XDBVR with 2 designs, and TPS54302DDCR, which is off the shortlist with 3 designs and whose successor status was not checked. Diodes DS41326 rev 3-2, Nov 2024: 3.8-32 V in, 2 A, fixed 3.30 V +/-1 percent (3.27-3.33 V), 1.1 MHz, TSOT-26, HS peak limit 2.5-3.1 A, table 2 values L 3.9 uH, Cin 10 uF, Cout 2 x 22 uF, Cboot 100 nF. SCHEMATIC WORK STILL OWED in the 3.3 V block: pinout differs (1 FB, 2 EN, 3 VIN, 4 GND, 5 SW, 6 BST against the sheet's 1 GND, 2 SW, 3 VIN, 4 FB, 5 EN, 6 BOOT), so replace the symbol, use footprint Package_TO_SOT_SMD:TSOT-23-6, tie FB directly to +3V3, remove the feedback divider and feedforward cap, and recheck the EN divider against the 1.18 V EN threshold. Lifecycle basis is the JLC catalogue only. Gate: lifecycle Unknown: jlcparts listing lists it, which is a catalogue listing, not a manufacturer status; no manufacturer lifecycle source is configured (no Digi-Key or Mouser key in parts.json), so the gate cannot prove Active; introduction date unknown (no datasheet first date, research report or curated row), so the age rule could not run"
			(at 49.53 16.51 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.Source" "jlcparts C780769"
			(at 49.53 16.51 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.Note" "Topology is TI SLVSD26 section 7.2 / Table 7-2 for 3.3 V: L 10 uH, Cout 2 x 22 uF, R2 100 k, R3 22.1 k, C6 56 pF across R2, CBOOT 0.1 uF; EN divider 511 k / 105 k from +12V (UVLO near 7 V). Pin map from the datasheet Table 4-1 (1 GND, 2 SW, 3 VIN, 4 FB, 5 EN, 6 BOOT); symbol Wright:TPS54202DDC is derived from the installed TPS54302 symbol, which has the same pinout. Output ceramics derate under 3.3 V bias, so the loop is not verified."
			(at 49.53 16.51 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
