		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Ceramic capacitor (MLCC) x2: needs C >= 20uF, V rated >= 10V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 251972, 0.0823 USD each at 2. C 22uF meets min 20uF; V rated 10V meets min 10V (355 other candidates passed) Chosen because: TPS54202 output capacitors, 2 x 22 uF 10 V X5R 0805 = 44 uF nominal per TI table 7-2 for 3.3 V; roughly half the capacitance remains at 3.3 V bias on a 10 V X5R 0805, so the real value is lower than 44 uF and the loop is NOT verified. JLC catalogue basis (passive)."
