				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-05 Voltage supervisor / reset IC x1: needs V threshold >= 2.9V, V threshold <= 3V. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 447, 0.3169 USD each at 1. V threshold 2.93V meets min 2.9V; V threshold 2.93V meets max 3V. Design-in: no open design in the corpus uses it. Freshness: catalogue freshness 0.00 (C1852118 is in the newest 17% of 1,634 listings in Supervisor and Reset ICs + Monitors and Reset Circuits); first released 2018. (12 other candidates passed; 2 other candidates on the shortlist) Chosen because: NRST supervisor, replaces TPS3808EG33DBVR (refused, research dates its datasheet family to 2004). Chosen because the TI TLV803E datasheet gives open-drain active-low, 2.93 V threshold, 200 ms delay, VDD 0.7-6 V, 250 nA, -40 to 125 C, Active Production in its ordering table, matching the spec's open-drain, 2.9-3.0 V and >= 20 ms lines; the AP63203 rail minimum of 3.27 V leaves about 340 mV before tolerance. Over TLV809EA29DBZR because that is push-pull and would fight the SWD reset on NRST; over TLV803EA29DBZR because 23 in stock against 447; over MCP1316MT-31LE/OT because its datasheet carries a 2005 copyright and 10 in stock; over NCV308SN330T1G, the only pin-compatible-looking 6-pin row checked, because its datasheet is dated 2014, over the age limit. No open design in the corpus uses it. SCHEMATIC WORK STILL OWED in the 3.3 V block: R pinout is 1 RESET, 2 GND, 3 VDD in SOT-23-3 (DBZ), so use footprint Package_TO_SOT_SMD:SOT-23, replace the 6-pin symbol and remove the CT cap, MR and SENSE wiring. Manual reset is dropped, which the spec lists as optional. Lifecycle basis is the JLC catalogue and the datasheet table; Digi-Key and Mouser keys are off. Gate: lifecycle Unknown: jlcparts listing lists it, which is a catalogue listing, not a manufacturer status; no manufacturer lifecycle source is configured (no Digi-Key or Mouser key in parts.json), so the gate cannot prove Active"
			(at 278.13 121.92 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.Source" "jlcparts C1852118"
			(at 278.13 121.92 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Wright.Note" "Pin map from TI TPS3808E Table 5-1: 1 RESET (open drain, 10 k pull-up R48), 2 GND, 3 MR (internal 90 k pull-up, left open), 4 CT (open = fixed delay), 5 SENSE and 6 VDD both on +3V3. Symbol Wright:TPS3808EG33 is derived from the installed MAX6355 SOT-23-6 symbol for its shape only; names/types are from the datasheet. NRST is also pulled low by the SWD header."
			(at 278.13 121.92 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
