		(property "Wright.Note" "Pin map read from the installed KiCad symbol MCU_ST_STM32G4:STM32G474RETx alternate-function table. Motor 1: TIM1 CH1/CH1N on PA8/PB13, CH2/CH2N on PA9/PB14, CH3/CH3N on PA10/PB15, BKIN on PB12; motor 2: TIM8 CH1/CH1N on PC6/PC10, CH2/CH2N on PC7/PC11, CH3/CH3N on PC8/PC12, BKIN on PD2. The low-side outputs drive the DRV8300UD INLx inputs, which are INVERTED: set the CHxN output polarity inverted in firmware. Shunt amplifiers: PA0/PA1/PC0 (motor 1) and PC1/PC2/PC3 (motor 2) on ADC1/ADC2 inputs, VBUS on PA4. Hall inputs: TIM3 CH1-3 on PB4/PB5/PB0 (motor 1) and TIM2 CH1-3 on PA15/PB3/PB10 (motor 2). UART header on USART2 PA2/PA3. SWD on PA13/PA14, BOOT0 on PB8, HSE on PF0/PF1, NRST on PG10. VREF+ is tied to +3V3 with VDDA (no ferrite or RC picked); ADC-reference noise is not verified. The spec net names M1_PWM_xx / M2_PWM_xx are not separate nets: those pins are the existing driver nets M1_INH_x/M1_INL_x, M2_INH_x/M2_INL_x."
			(at 350.52 149.86 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1 1)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
