		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Any part (keyword only) x1: needs no electrical constraint. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 2375, 0.2739 USD each at 1.  (0 other candidates passed) Chosen because: SWD header, 1 x 5 pin header 2.54 mm (right edge): 3V3, SWCLK, GND, SWDIO, NRST. Wurth Elektronik WR-PHD 61300511121 (1x5, 2.54 mm, 3 A, 6 mm tail), 2,375 at JLC. The connector-kind constraint pins >= 5 was not accepted because the catalogue row does not state the pin count as a number, so it was picked by MPN through the generic lookup. Through-hole on the top side, so single-sided assembly holds. Lifecycle basis is the JLC catalogue only (Digi-Key and Mouser keys off); a long-established part type."
			(at 325.12 229.87 0)
