		(property "Wright.PickReason" "2026-11-03 Any part (keyword only) x1: needs no electrical constraint. jlcparts Active (catalog status field (JLC/LCSC listing, not the manufacturer)), stock 188, 0.0972 USD each at 1.  (0 other candidates passed) Chosen because: Status LED, green, power-OK (3.3 V rail), lower-right cluster. ROHM SML-310MTT86 0603, 570 nm, Vf 2.2 V, 20 mA max, 188 in JLC stock. At 3.3 V with 470 ohm the current is about 2.3 mA: dim but visible; a brighter bin or a lower resistor is the tuning knob. Blue LEDs were rejected for this rail (Vf about 3.3 V leaves no headroom). Lifecycle basis is the JLC catalogue only; ROHM SML series is long established, no successor named."
